    "name": "Library API",
    "description": "Runnable contract for the Pedro Node course Express API: cookie JWT auth plus personal book library.\n\nSynced to Postman workspace `pedro-node-course` (collection uid 60278085-9886ce65-1981-4d8c-ba7d-29246867d89a).\n\n`GET /books` is public. Auth cookie required for library routes. Catalog create/delete require ADMIN role.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
